ets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies.mdx","Estrategias de aprovisionamiento","Elige cómo se registra el dispositivo, quién autoriza su identidad y dónde se genera la clave.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies",{"_77":256},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/provisioning-strategies.mdx",{"_53":258,"_60":71,"_55":30,"_65":259,"_74":-7,"_11":29,"_75":260},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx","Define registro, autenticación por operación, emisión, renovación y confianza distribuida.",{"_77":261},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx",{"_53":263,"_60":71,"_55":25,"_65":264,"_74":-7,"_11":23,"_75":265},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.",{"_77":266},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_53":268,"_60":71,"_55":269,"_65":270,"_74":-7,"_11":271,"_75":272},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_77":273},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_53":275,"_60":71,"_55":276,"_65":277,"_74":-7,"_11":278,"_75":279},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_77":280},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_53":282,"_60":71,"_55":283,"_65":284,"_74":-7,"_11":285,"_75":286},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_77":287},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distrib