os y dependencias de infraestructura.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/deployment/troubleshooting",{"_77":426},"deployment/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_53":428,"_60":98,"_74":-7,"_55":429},"es:_9","Otros modelos",{"_53":431,"_60":71,"_55":432,"_65":433,"_74":-7,"_11":434,"_75":435},"es:deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_77":436},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_53":438,"_60":71,"_55":439,"_65":440,"_74":-7,"_11":441,"_75":442},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/deployment/saas",{"_77":443},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_210":446},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/images/kubernetes.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_60":61,"_55":449,"_62":63,"_64":-7,"_65":450,"_67":-7,"_57":451,"_53":457,"_75":458,"_74":460},"Actualizaciones","Guía de versión a versión para el operador",[452],{"_53":453,"_60":71,"_55":45,"_65":454,"_74":-7,"_11":44,"_75":455},"es:upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","Qué cambia en la arquitectura de 4.0.0, qué cambios rompen un despliegue 3.8.0, cómo actualizar paso a paso una release de Helm y cómo validar el resultado.",{"_77":456},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","es:upgrades",{"_210":459},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 12-4-4-4 4\"></path><p